6 feet<br />\r\nCell Tower 18 m / 61 feet<br />\r\nBig Bridge 280 m / 922 feet<br />\r\nWindow Washing 125 m / 412 feet<br />\r\nPirate Ship 41 m / 134 feet<br />\r\nOil Rigg 43 m / 142 feet<br />\r\nHot Air Balloon 195 m / 638 feet<br />\r\nMoving Train 4.2 m / 14 feet<br />\r\nFerris Wheel 124 m / 406 feet<br />\r\nCity Crane 81 m / 267 feet<br />\r\nParachute 198 m / 648 feet<br />\r\nTwo Plane 262 m / 860 feet<br />\r\nHelicopter Blade 3 m / 10 feet<br />\r\nRoller Coaster 108 m / 355 feet<br />\r\nTwo Helicopter 144 m / 473 feet",
